Defn.lean (CM abelian varieties)
--------------------------------
Line numbers as of 2026-10-26. CMStructure, basechange (modulo
dimension_isStableUnderBasechange), the F-module structure on the
rational lattice ℚ ⊗[ℤ] lattice (A _ ℂ) and F ≃ₗ[F] (ℚ ⊗[ℤ] L) (`u`) are
done. CMType ι is now defined as preCMType.ofComplexStructure (J_one ι),
where J is multiplication by i on Lie (A _ ℂ) transported to ℝ ⊗[ℚ] F via
u_ℝ : ℝ ⊗[ℚ] F ≃ₗ[ℝ] Lie (A _ ℂ). J_one, u_ℝ_one_tmul_mul, u_mul,
ψ₂_tmul are proved, modulo the sorries below.
[ ] lattice_incl_smul                                                (l.221)
      i (incl (x • v)) = σ(ι x) (i (incl v)), with i = lattice_isLattice_map,
      σ = rationalEnd_lie_algebra_represenation. The `add` case is done,
      the `tmul` case is `sorry`; u_ℝ_one_tmul_mul depends on it.
      Plan: generalize from ι x to any e : End⁰ (A _ ℂ) and induct on e
      too. Needs: the map End⁰ → Module.End ℚ (ℚ ⊗[ℤ] L) pulled out of
      CMField_ringHom_rationalLattice as a named def (inlining it as a
      `let` times out), and `tmul` lemmas (proved by rfl) for it, for
      rationalEnd_lie_algebra_represenation and for lattice_isLattice_map.
      Note: rw [Algebra.TensorProduct.lift_tmul] does not fire on
      ℚ ⊗[ℤ] End (mk _) (only erw works) and some rw's time out; maybe two
      ℤ-module structures on End (mk A) (hom-group vs ring). Unconfirmed.
[ ] Check the dimension condition: Module.finrank ℚ F : ℕ is compared
      with topologicalKrullDim A.left : WithBot ℕ∞ (via a cast). Decide
      whether to state dim A as a natural number instead. (In
      finrank_rational_lattice_of_CMStructure the cast is undone with
      `norm_cast`.)
[ ] dimension_isStableUnderBasechange                                (l.84)
      dim X = dim (X _ K₁) for X locally of finite type over K.
      [LocallyOfFiniteType X.hom] is needed: without it the statement is
      false (X = Spec K(t), K₁ = K(t)). Nothing in Mathlib proves it;
      smoothOfRelativeDimension_isStableUnderBaseChange does not help
      (no link between relative dimension and Krull dimension).
      Possible proof: reduce to affines, Noether normalization
      (exists_integral_inj_algHom_of_fg) and "finite injective extensions
      preserve Krull dimension" (not found in Mathlib). Should be moved
      to AlgebraicGeometry/ (e.g. Dimension.lean).
[ ] End.algHom_ofBaseChange (l.70) lives in namespace CMStructure, but is
      a general fact about endomorphisms; could be moved out.
[ ] Cleanup: the `#check
      smoothOfRelativeDimension_isStableUnderBaseChange` (l.82), the
      "Hey claude, remind me to move this to another file about
      dimensions" comment (l.79), and `#check lattice_isLattice_map`
      (l.254). u_ℚ_mul could be proved by `exact u_mul ι a b`.
      ψ₂_tmul uses `erw [TensorProduct.map_tmul]`; an `incl_tmul` rfl
      lemma would avoid it.


